WEBVTT

00:00:01.870 --> 00:00:03.520
You've been caught 
red-handed for smuggling.

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:09.210
The goods will be confiscated,

00:00:09.210 --> 00:00:10.940
and you will be taken into custody.

00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:16.780
What was that?

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:18.950
Looks like some trouble.

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:21.120
I'm gonna check it out!

00:00:22.070 --> 00:00:22.910
Hey!

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:38.380
I'm gonna lend a hand!

00:00:44.090 --> 00:00:45.940
There's no need for that!

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:50.770
You should learn to accept 
the generosity of others.

00:00:51.090 --> 00:00:52.980
What you're offering is called

00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:55.110
an unwelcome favor.

00:00:56.620 --> 00:00:58.250
You're not cute.

00:00:58.250 --> 00:01:00.900
I'd prefer you didn't think that I'm cute.

00:01:13.870 --> 00:01:15.010
I'm not letting you get away!

00:01:16.820 --> 00:01:19.620
If they're in a car, there're only 
certain routes they can take.

00:01:19.620 --> 00:01:21.570
We can catch up by using the back roads!

00:01:23.620 --> 00:01:25.020
Wh-What?

00:01:25.740 --> 00:01:26.770
Hurry up.

00:01:27.610 --> 00:01:28.650
I know!

00:01:30.270 --> 00:01:33.080
There's some trouble at the harbor.

00:01:33.080 --> 00:01:34.030
Trouble?

00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:35.390
Here you go.

00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:38.740
Lasagna!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:40.960
I've been waiting for you!

00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:43.130
Thank you for the meal!

00:01:43.570 --> 00:01:44.390
Hey!

00:01:53.020 --> 00:01:54.320
Milady.

00:01:54.930 --> 00:01:56.970
What is it now, Luca?

00:01:59.920 --> 00:02:02.960
Th-The party tonight is 
a very special one.

00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:05.060
We should start heading 
back to the mansion.

00:02:05.740 --> 00:02:09.060
There'll be plenty of time, 
even after we finish our patrol.

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:11.560
Yes, but...

00:02:11.560 --> 00:02:13.980
You'll also need time to change.

00:02:20.380 --> 00:02:22.240
Found you!

00:02:23.580 --> 00:02:24.860
Libertá?

00:02:26.220 --> 00:02:27.620
That idiot.

00:02:27.620 --> 00:02:29.040
He's too reckless.

00:02:29.300 --> 00:02:30.410
Nova.

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:32.500
Felicitá.

00:02:37.650 --> 00:02:40.090
Don't move, Libertá.

00:02:41.770 --> 00:02:42.590
Debito!

00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:51.350
Jump, Libertá!

00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:53.310
Are you serious?!

00:02:56.980 --> 00:02:58.680
That's dangerous, Dante!

00:02:58.680 --> 00:03:00.070
No need to worry.

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:03.950
See?

00:03:04.380 --> 00:03:05.650
Pace.

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:08.250
Move!

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:29.640
I-I surrender.

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:35.180
And that settles that.

00:03:35.180 --> 00:03:36.450
Dante,

00:03:36.450 --> 00:03:39.320
what are we going to do about the car?

00:03:42.290 --> 00:03:43.990
I was about to die!

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:45.740
Your actions are too bold!

00:03:45.740 --> 00:03:48.720
Well, I am bald.

00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:50.430
Just kidding!

00:03:51.360 --> 00:03:52.940
Let's go.

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:58.590
Who are those people?

00:03:58.980 --> 00:04:00.650
That was intense.

00:04:00.650 --> 00:04:03.610
Is this your first time here, boys?

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:07.750
I'm curious if this is the first time

00:04:07.750 --> 00:04:10.060
you've been to the trade island of Regalo.

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:11.910
Y-Yes.

00:04:11.910 --> 00:04:13.640
Then let me tell you.

00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:17.050
Clean out your ears and listen well.

00:04:17.050 --> 00:04:20.990
They are the vigilante organization 
that protects Regalo Island,

00:04:22.100 --> 00:04:23.990
the Arcana Famiglia.

00:06:00.270 --> 00:06:01.880
Milady.

00:06:02.900 --> 00:06:05.650
What did you just say?

00:06:05.650 --> 00:06:07.470
You mustn't.

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:10.270
This isn't just some ordinary party.

00:06:13.150 --> 00:06:14.140
Milady.

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:17.600
Everyone is waiting for you.

00:06:22.630 --> 00:06:24.490
Milady!

00:06:24.490 --> 00:06:25.820
What's the matter, Luca?

00:06:26.260 --> 00:06:29.240
You're not attending the party 
in those clothes, are you?

00:06:29.360 --> 00:06:29.650
Yeah.

00:06:31.670 --> 00:06:33.650
You mustn't!

00:06:33.650 --> 00:06:34.320
Today is—

00:06:34.320 --> 00:06:36.520
Papa's birthday, right?

00:06:36.520 --> 00:06:38.120
Let's go, Fukulota.

00:06:40.980 --> 00:06:43.920
She used to be much more obedient.

00:06:44.440 --> 00:06:47.500
Maybe there's a problem 
with how you raised her.

00:06:47.500 --> 00:06:48.150
Huh?

00:06:48.150 --> 00:06:52.150
Indeed, you were her attendant 
since she was little.

00:06:52.150 --> 00:06:52.820
Huh?

00:06:52.820 --> 00:06:54.990
It's all your fault, Luca.

00:06:54.990 --> 00:06:55.640
Huh?!

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:57.890
We're going to be late, Luca!

00:06:59.020 --> 00:07:01.500
Right away, Milady!

00:07:11.470 --> 00:07:12.800
What's wrong?

00:07:14.370 --> 00:07:17.290
What are you wearing, Bambina?

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:21.750
We were all looking forward 
to seeing you in a dress.

00:07:22.430 --> 00:07:24.370
What's wrong with what I'm wearing?

00:07:24.370 --> 00:07:27.610
Luca, do your job as her attendant!

00:07:27.610 --> 00:07:30.910
Yeah! It's bad enough that we're 
constantly surrounded by just guys!

00:07:30.910 --> 00:07:32.260
But I...

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:34.940
But I wanted her to wear a dress, too!

00:07:34.940 --> 00:07:36.060
However,

00:07:36.520 --> 00:07:38.500
if something were to happen, 
it's probably better

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:41.310
for her to be wearing something 
less restrictive than a dress.

00:07:42.890 --> 00:07:44.150
You've got a point.

00:07:44.920 --> 00:07:48.550
It's easier to admire Bambina's 
long, beautiful legs

00:07:48.550 --> 00:07:51.180
with what she's got on now.

00:07:51.180 --> 00:07:54.030
Do you have a leg fetish, shorty?

00:07:55.090 --> 00:07:57.270
We may agree on something.

00:07:57.910 --> 00:07:59.270
How stupid.

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:11.420
Huh?

00:08:12.630 --> 00:08:14.680
You're not wearing a dress, Princess?

00:08:23.150 --> 00:08:24.630
What's wrong?

00:08:24.630 --> 00:08:25.790
Princess?

00:08:25.790 --> 00:08:26.770
Your face is red.

00:08:32.770 --> 00:08:34.280
Ouch.

00:08:35.140 --> 00:08:37.750
What the hell was that for?

00:08:39.130 --> 00:08:42.350
Wh-What the hell did I do, Princess?!

00:08:45.280 --> 00:08:46.360
Jolly.

00:08:46.360 --> 00:08:49.490
It's because you were thinking bad things.

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:52.300
What do you mean, "bad things?"

00:08:52.570 --> 00:08:57.100
This shouldn't need explaining 
again, but we have all

00:08:57.100 --> 00:09:02.270
made a deal with Tarocco to 
gain our Arcana powers.

00:09:02.270 --> 00:09:04.260
For example, you, Libertá,

00:09:04.260 --> 00:09:09.900
have the first card, 
Il Matto: the Fool.

00:09:10.450 --> 00:09:11.860
R-Right.

00:09:12.310 --> 00:09:21.610
Nova, just like you have the 
13th card, La Morte: Death.

00:09:21.610 --> 00:09:23.750
You don't have to explain 
all of this now.

00:09:24.590 --> 00:09:29.630
Milady made a deal with the sixth card,

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:33.100
Gli Amanti: the Lovers.

00:09:34.380 --> 00:09:39.330
Her power, by that I mean 
her Arcana power,

00:09:39.330 --> 00:09:42.850
is the power to see 
into others' hearts.

00:09:43.370 --> 00:09:44.520
Then...

00:09:49.530 --> 00:09:52.110
But I just saw it by chance.

00:09:52.110 --> 00:09:57.740
Yes. Arcana powers use emotions 
as their foundation.

00:09:58.670 --> 00:10:02.530
The reason you don't have control 
over your powers yet, Milady,

00:10:03.420 --> 00:10:05.610
is because you're still just a child.

00:10:07.230 --> 00:10:09.170
Please do not touch the lady.

00:10:17.890 --> 00:10:20.840
She read Libertá's heart?

00:10:21.460 --> 00:10:26.330
Does that mean you were thinking of Milady in unbecoming ways?!

00:10:25.790 --> 00:10:26.850
Idiot

00:10:26.330 --> 00:10:27.940
The hell do you mean, 
"unbecoming ways?!"

00:10:28.250 --> 00:10:30.770
W-Well...

00:10:36.840 --> 00:10:39.560
My apologies, Milady...

00:10:39.560 --> 00:10:41.470
My condolences.

00:10:41.470 --> 00:10:42.780
Hey!

00:10:42.780 --> 00:10:45.240
Dante's going to give his greeting.

00:10:47.060 --> 00:10:48.340
Gentlemen,

00:10:48.340 --> 00:10:49.880
I would like to thank everyone

00:10:49.880 --> 00:10:52.420
for showing up despite 
your busy schedules,

00:10:52.420 --> 00:10:55.730
for the sake of our Arcana 
Famiglia's "Papa," Mondo.

00:10:56.190 --> 00:10:58.800
We would like to start 
with a word from Papa.

00:11:01.650 --> 00:11:03.280
The head of our family!

00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:04.740
Glory to Arcana!

00:11:04.740 --> 00:11:05.920
Gentlemen.

00:11:05.920 --> 00:11:08.080
Thank you for gathering today.

00:11:08.740 --> 00:11:11.760
I am celebrating my 
59th birthday today.

00:11:12.340 --> 00:11:15.820
The reason I have gotten this 
far is because of all of you.

00:11:17.620 --> 00:11:19.480
Our Regalo Island

00:11:19.480 --> 00:11:21.620
has overcome many hardships.

00:11:22.260 --> 00:11:25.810
Raids from smugglers, occupation 
from foreign countries,

00:11:25.810 --> 00:11:27.580
lack of goods,

00:11:27.580 --> 00:11:30.470
oppression from a tyrant, epidemics...

00:11:31.200 --> 00:11:33.820
Once you start counting, 
there's no end.

00:11:33.820 --> 00:11:37.240
But we were able to overcome all 
of this with our familial bond,

00:11:37.240 --> 00:11:41.470
and with the Arcana powers.

00:11:42.630 --> 00:11:45.640
But I've gotten to that age.

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:47.930
I'm starting to think about retirement.

00:11:50.080 --> 00:11:51.270
Papa?

00:11:51.520 --> 00:11:52.940
Therefore,

00:11:52.940 --> 00:11:56.650
I am considering choosing 
someone to take my place.

00:11:59.840 --> 00:12:03.320
In two months, we will be 
holding the Arcana Duello.

00:12:04.520 --> 00:12:06.790
Arcana Duello?

00:12:07.900 --> 00:12:11.350
It will be a fight where all those 
with Arcana powers will participate

00:12:11.350 --> 00:12:15.130
to determine who has the 
strongest Arcana powers.

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:23.010
I, the 21st card, Il Mondo: 
The World, hereby swear

00:12:24.140 --> 00:12:27.490
to give the victor the title of "Papa"

00:12:28.110 --> 00:12:30.270
and grant their wish.

00:12:32.260 --> 00:12:34.360
One more thing.

00:12:35.740 --> 00:12:39.230
The winner will marry 
my daughter, Felicitá.

00:12:56.360 --> 00:12:57.850
Marry the Princess?

00:12:57.850 --> 00:13:00.050
What are you thinking, Papa?

00:13:00.990 --> 00:13:04.090
What? What does that mean?

00:13:04.090 --> 00:13:06.010
Well, this will get interesting.

00:13:15.600 --> 00:13:17.630
What is it, Felicitá?

00:13:18.290 --> 00:13:20.540
Do you have any concerns?

00:13:21.160 --> 00:13:24.110
I don't want to get married.

00:13:24.630 --> 00:13:29.090
You chose with your own free will 
to join the Arcana Famiglia.

00:13:29.090 --> 00:13:31.760
This is the rule of the family.

00:13:31.760 --> 00:13:35.620
Meaning, you have to do as I say.

00:13:36.790 --> 00:13:38.360
Am I wrong?

00:13:40.950 --> 00:13:45.800
You will become the new Mama, 
and support the family.

00:13:46.630 --> 00:13:48.590
What's the reason for this, Papa?

00:13:49.410 --> 00:13:51.060
There is a reason.

00:13:51.060 --> 00:13:54.310
However, I need not explain myself.

00:13:56.620 --> 00:13:57.730
Oh?

00:13:59.090 --> 00:14:01.580
If you don't want to follow orders,

00:14:01.580 --> 00:14:03.800
challenge me here and win.

00:14:03.800 --> 00:14:04.660
Papa!

00:14:04.660 --> 00:14:05.720
That's impossible!

00:14:05.720 --> 00:14:07.360
Just shut up.

00:14:08.750 --> 00:14:10.370
This looks interesting.

00:14:16.420 --> 00:14:19.250
Is that all your kick has to offer?

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:28.080
Princess...

00:14:29.240 --> 00:14:31.080
I will choose...

00:14:31.080 --> 00:14:32.720
my own path!

00:14:33.830 --> 00:14:36.600
You haven't the right to 
choose your own path...

00:14:38.100 --> 00:14:40.230
in your present condition!

00:14:44.860 --> 00:14:45.860
Princess!

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:46.780
Milady!

00:14:53.530 --> 00:14:56.120
If you're just going 
to sit there and glare,

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:57.620
a little child can do that, too.

00:14:59.070 --> 00:15:03.090
Why not try shedding a 
tear or two, as well?

00:15:03.940 --> 00:15:06.400
You may be able to earn 
the pity of the men

00:15:06.400 --> 00:15:08.840
who are going to participate 
in the Arcana Duello.

00:15:12.470 --> 00:15:16.320
You're robbing the Princess 
of her freedom.

00:15:17.920 --> 00:15:20.520
How can you call yourself a father?!

00:15:20.930 --> 00:15:23.270
What are you doing, Libertá?

00:15:23.710 --> 00:15:26.400
Well done, Libertá the fool!

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:28.940
Your careless, no regard 
outbursts are fantastic!

00:15:29.310 --> 00:15:31.950
Don't instigate him, Debito!

00:15:32.840 --> 00:15:36.200
Are you saying you can't follow 
orders either, Libertá?

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:38.200
That's right!

00:15:39.050 --> 00:15:43.060
Then defeat me, right here, right now.

00:15:43.820 --> 00:15:45.730
What's the matter?

00:15:45.730 --> 00:15:49.590
Are you scared of making a fool 
of yourself, like Felicitá?

00:15:50.860 --> 00:15:54.000
There's no guarantee...

00:15:57.550 --> 00:15:59.390
that I'm going to make 
a fool of myself!

00:16:02.250 --> 00:16:03.100
Libertá!

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:08.850
Nova!

00:16:08.850 --> 00:16:12.520
Papa is the father of 
our family, as well.

00:16:13.330 --> 00:16:15.450
I won't condone any harm

00:16:16.400 --> 00:16:17.950
toward our father.

00:16:21.750 --> 00:16:23.000
Move!

00:16:32.680 --> 00:16:33.590
Debito?

00:16:34.230 --> 00:16:36.100
Very perceptive.

00:16:36.920 --> 00:16:43.100
I made a deal with the ninth 
card, L'eremita: the Hermit.

00:16:43.950 --> 00:16:47.930
So your powers are to make 
yourself invisible.

00:16:47.930 --> 00:16:49.230
Let me go!

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:50.480
Let go of me!

00:16:51.910 --> 00:16:54.550
Would you let me go, you meathead!

00:16:54.550 --> 00:16:56.160
I understand how you feel, but

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:58.830
it's not good if you disobey Papa.

00:17:00.110 --> 00:17:01.570
Pace has

00:17:01.570 --> 00:17:07.080
a deal with the 11th card, 
La Forza: Strength.

00:17:07.620 --> 00:17:09.530
His strength is overwhelming.

00:17:09.530 --> 00:17:11.970
No one can oppose it.

00:17:13.740 --> 00:17:14.630
Let go.

00:17:15.660 --> 00:17:16.970
Let me go!

00:17:18.040 --> 00:17:19.100
What?

00:17:27.090 --> 00:17:28.480
How pitiful.

00:17:30.710 --> 00:17:33.550
If you want to free my daughter,

00:17:33.550 --> 00:17:35.920
then you need to win the Arcana Duello.

00:17:37.310 --> 00:17:38.790
I told you.

00:17:41.970 --> 00:17:45.120
I will grant any wish.

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:50.090
Felicitá.

00:17:52.340 --> 00:17:53.570
Mama.

00:17:54.010 --> 00:17:56.470
There is a way for you to win as well.

00:17:58.090 --> 00:17:59.970
You're going to choose

00:18:00.410 --> 00:18:02.430
your own path, right?

00:18:11.120 --> 00:18:15.150
The Wheel of Fortune 
has started turning,

00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:19.990
opposing the guidance of the Tarocco.

00:18:22.190 --> 00:18:25.630
There's no way I'd get married,

00:18:25.630 --> 00:18:29.600
but I wouldn't mind being 
bound with Bambina.

00:18:29.910 --> 00:18:31.910
Debito, how dare you?!

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:38.840
I'm sure every day would be fun 
if the Princess were my wife.

00:18:39.340 --> 00:18:41.720
Pace, you, too?

00:18:42.360 --> 00:18:45.930
Then what are you going to do 
about the Arcana Duello, Luca?

00:18:45.930 --> 00:18:48.710
I will cheer on Milady!

00:18:48.710 --> 00:18:51.400
However, Papa said,

00:18:52.040 --> 00:18:56.030
that everyone with Arcana 
powers will be fighting.

00:18:58.650 --> 00:19:01.490
Bambina is a heartless woman.

00:19:02.220 --> 00:19:07.000
However, that can be rather charming.

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:12.380
Mondo has thought up 
something rather absurd.

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:18.780
I'm getting all excited thinking 
of Milady as my bride.

00:19:19.230 --> 00:19:21.430
Jolly, you...

00:19:21.430 --> 00:19:24.850
What? Do you think I'll lose?

00:19:25.920 --> 00:19:28.860
Unfortunately, that's 
not going to happen.

00:19:28.860 --> 00:19:32.430
That is, if I take this seriously.

00:19:40.710 --> 00:19:42.060
Libertá.

00:19:43.050 --> 00:19:44.910
Don't worry, Princess!

00:19:45.640 --> 00:19:46.360
What?

00:19:47.020 --> 00:19:49.870
I'm going to win this and 
take the title of "Papa."

00:19:50.470 --> 00:19:51.920
Then...

00:19:51.920 --> 00:19:54.840
I'll be your bride?

00:19:57.100 --> 00:19:58.890
No!

00:19:58.890 --> 00:20:00.510
Th-That's not what I meant!

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:02.550
Um...

00:20:03.180 --> 00:20:07.580
Anyway, it means you'll 
regain your freedom.

00:20:07.580 --> 00:20:08.520
Right?

00:20:11.910 --> 00:20:13.480
That's right.

00:20:14.080 --> 00:20:17.620
You may end up my bride...

00:20:18.960 --> 00:20:22.040
But that's sort of weird 
to think about.

00:20:23.570 --> 00:20:24.950
You're so oblivious.

00:20:25.760 --> 00:20:28.620
What do you mean by 
"oblivious," you chickpea.

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:31.290
Don't call me a chickpea!

00:20:32.130 --> 00:20:35.460
You can barely control 
your Arcana powers,

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:38.130
yet you're foolish enough to say 
you'll win the Arcana Duello.

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:40.270
If that's not oblivious, then what is it?

00:20:42.750 --> 00:20:46.540
I made the decision to 
live by this sword.

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:51.520
So I have no need for Arcana powers.

00:20:53.820 --> 00:20:56.160
You truly are oblivious.

00:20:56.160 --> 00:21:00.680
But you can't use your 
Arcana powers either.

00:21:02.090 --> 00:21:06.490
I've never seen you use 
your Arcana powers.

00:21:06.490 --> 00:21:08.520
Don't compare me with you!

00:21:13.300 --> 00:21:15.420
Don't worry, Felicitá.

00:21:17.500 --> 00:21:24.050
If I were to win, 
I'll wish not to marry you.

00:21:27.220 --> 00:21:31.390
That means if either of us wins,

00:21:31.390 --> 00:21:33.660
then Princess will be free!

00:21:33.660 --> 00:21:37.750
The likelihood of you 
winning is rather slim.

00:21:38.640 --> 00:21:40.810
The hell did you say, you chickpea?!

00:21:40.810 --> 00:21:42.110
The truth.

00:21:43.510 --> 00:21:45.570
And don't call me a chickpea.

00:23:31.920 --> 00:23:34.050
Ciao! So, next time's story 
involves Princess and me

00:23:34.050 --> 00:23:35.610
looking for the owner of a lost cat?

00:23:35.610 --> 00:23:37.670
It should be a lot of fun since 
it's just me and the Princess...

00:23:37.670 --> 00:23:40.460
What? The chickpea's coming, too? Ugh...
